          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"140\") (name \"NET0203\") ... (node (ref \"U1\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"VCC1\")) ... (node (ref \"U3\") (pin \"18\") (pinfunction \"VDD\")) ... (node (ref \"U30\") (pin \"8\") (pinfunction \"VDD\")) ... (node (ref \"U40\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"VCC1\")) ... (node (ref \"U46\") (pin \"18\") (pinfunction \"VDD\")) ... (node (ref \"U47\") (pin \"8\") (pinfunction \"VDD\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"1\") (name \"+3V3\") ... (node (ref \"U13\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"VO\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Without a supply on NET0203, these devices cannot function normally; the CAN interfaces and UART expansion circuitry are likely inoperative.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomaly detected: multiple CAN and UART IC supply pins share NET0203, which has no connection to a power rail or supply source in the netlist. This leaves key interface circuitry unpowered."
}

